  "body": "Occupying the entire second floor of Sonata—a boutique collection of just five exclusive residences—this brand new, architecturally designed apartment offers 254 square metres of luxurious internal living, complemented by a 24 square metre north-facing balcony. Positioned in the heart of one of Auckland’s most desirable coastal suburbs, this is a rare offering that blends scale, privacy, and timeless sophistication in an environment defined by natural beauty and relaxed seaside living.\r\n\r\nDesigned by acclaimed architects Buchan, Sonata presents a bold, sculptural presence that integrates beautifully into its elevated setting. Panoramic views over the Waitemata Harbour to Rangitoto Island provide a spectacular backdrop to everyday life, while full-floor living ensures a sense of seclusion and serenity rarely found in apartment living.\r\n\r\nInteriors have been thoughtfully planned to enhance the natural light and views, with expansive open-plan living, dining, and media areas that extend seamlessly to the balcony—perfect for relaxed alfresco entertaining. At the heart of the home, the designer kitchen by Studio Italia features Poliform cabinetry, marble benchtops, Gaggenau appliances, and the added convenience of a butler’s pantry—blending high performance with timeless style.\r\n\r\nThe apartment includes three generously proportioned bedrooms, with the master suite and second bedroom each enjoying their own private ensuite. A third beautifully finished full bathroom serves the remaining bedroom and guests. The master retreat also features a generous walk-in wardrobe and a luxurious ensuite complete with freestanding bath. Additional highlights include a full separate laundry, extensive integrated storage, and thoughtful service areas to support effortless day-to-day living.\r\n\r\nWith direct lift access, no shared walls, and complete floor exclusivity, residents enjoy the ultimate in privacy and security. The apartment also includes three secure basement carparks, a large private lock-up storage room, and provision for an EV charging station.\r\n\r\nSt Heliers bay offers an enviable lifestyle— a collaboration of village charm with a beach vibe. Just steps from your door, enjoy secure private access to the waterfront and vibrant village centre, where boutique shopping, cafes, eateries, and essential amenities abound. Zoned for top-performing schools and just 15 minutes from the CBD, this tightly held suburb blends relaxed sophistication with everyday convenience.\r\n\r\n\r\nImportant: This property may be marketed as suitable for overseas purchasers. However, this does not constitute confirmation of eligibility, approval, or suitability for any individual buyer. All overseas purchasers remain subject to New Zealand’s overseas investment laws, including the Overseas Investment Act 2005, and may require consent from the Overseas Investment Office. You must obtain your own independent legal, financial, and technical advice and secure any necessary approvals before proceeding with a purchase.",
